 "profile": {
  "id": "zafina",
  "name": "Zafina",
  "short": "Zafina",
  "color": "hsl(120 70% 62%)",
  "overview": "Zafina is a stance-based character with strong movement and space control. Her toolkit allows for stylish play, with some tricky moves and stance transitions, while still retaining the ability to play in a solid, fundamental way thanks to her backdash and spacing options.",
  "playstyle": "Stance-based space control with strong movement. Keep the opponent out with long, evasive moves and a good backdash and sidestep, then mix them up from Scarecrow (SCR), Mantis (MNT) and Tarantula (TRT). Wavu warns her moves are slow and committal, easy to whiff punish, and her fast punishes deal little damage.",
  "strengths": [
   "Many evasive options",
   "Good backdash and sidestep",
   "Strong keepout",
   "Good stance pressure and mixups",
   "Azazel moves are highly damaging and many deal heavy chip damage and plus frames on block"
  ],
  "weaknesses": [
   "Slow, committal moves; easy to whiff punish",
   "Lows outside of her stances deal little damage",
   "Has the lowest damaging i11-i14 punishment from crouch in the game",
   "No standing launcher until i16",
   "Azazel moves consume health when not in heat"
  ],
